      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "When first receiving quotes from multiple companies they fell into 3 categories - expensive local, cheap online with bad reviews and cheap online with good reviews (not many). I was initially concerned about the low cost - but a cheaper system has a quicker payback period/ROI. What was important was the length of time the company has been around, and the reviews given. Solar World have been around for 12 Years and had many recent positive reviews.Ryan from Solar World was extremely helpful when discussing options, turnaround time for responses was beyond expectations (super quick and after hours). Installation went great, system looks tidy and is performing well. I got Seraphim panels (13.2kw) and Growatt inverter (10kw) - all running as expected and without any issues (2 months on).I previously had a 4kw system, so the job included removal and disposal of existing as well. The new system upgrade was definitely worth it and can easily run multiple power-hungry air-con, whitegoods and appliances.I would highly recommend Solar World.",
