      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "This review is true and an actual reflection of my experience with Solar World...I would like to sincerely thank you and your team for installing our solar panels at Europa Street, Box Hill on 15th / 16th April 2020.From start to finish, the job was done well The installers worked all day in the hot weather until night time to get most of the work done and returned the next day to do touch up etc. They are good hard working people!Also, I would like to thank the manager personally for all of your assistance from the first time we got in touch with you. Your customer service is amazing and your pricing / packages are fantastic.On another note, the system has consistently been generating HUGE KW hours. Even on a cloudy day, we generate very good numbers!So what happened from 15th April to 13th July? A $232.29 credit is what happened!!! So AGL paid us into our bank account and reset the quarter to $0. Guess what? We are now in a $31.43 CREDIT and we have 69 days to go until the quarter is finished.Even in Winter as the cooler weather gets a tad warmer, the system has been producing some BIG numbers that we can monitor via WiFi with our SOLIS inverter:- 3/8 - 40.2kWh, 2/8 - 42.6kWh, 1/8 - 44.8kWh. With those kinds of numbers, AGL should be VERY afraid of our house haha.Please feel free to use this email as a testimony of my gratitude towards Solar World. We are thankful that you have helped us save money and live bill-free.Wishing you and the team at Solar World all the success now and into the future.",
